{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "90be7b1d24a4590480a5286f0110ce614ec2a490acc0fa0f6b8c55d32b189e5a", "ja": "BGMはユーロビートで", "zh": "BGM就放欧陆舞曲", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9b13f02d2e1aedde0acd9e8c042d0626cd62936ed2f45c0d07b6dbd4d2b8acd0", "ja": "取れ高を期待し、歌織に車の運転を任せてみ\nたプロデューサーだったが、映像に残しては\nいけないアイドル達の表情を量産しただけだ\nった……気を取り直し、歌織、可奈、可憐、\nジュリアのインタビューとなる。", "zh": "制作人期待着能拍到精彩素材，试着把开车交给歌织，\n结果只是让偶像们露出了不该被记录在影像中的表情，\n一连拍下了好多张……调整好心情后，开始采访歌织、\n可奈、可怜和茱莉亚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_05_1000_null", "source_sha256": "02038738481c28cd10a3afdbb1d14e455e777fcba4410399230882a884d42858", "ja": "ブロロオオォーン……キキーッ！！！\n……ガチャ、バタン！", "zh": "轰隆隆隆……吱——！！！\n……咔嚓，砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_05_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "1eb4f1994f974a82e7baf20b6d2fcadc325a8df3ba0dc506a929276d0ecfcbdd", "ja": "くっ……お、おい、{$P$}！\nなんだってカオリに運転任せちまったんだよ！？", "zh": "可恶……喂、{$P$}！\n我怎么就把开车的事交给歌织了啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_05_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d1aec6dda1f9be6b5753ac806c80566ab3b822fa863dd98d73a6df33a31f39be", "ja": "い、いや、面白いシーンが撮れそうだと\n思ったんだけど……うぅ。", "zh": "不、不是，我本来以为能拍到\n有趣的画面嘛……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_05_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "51a1c6a930ea950b3c4a28cc3f19aa678865ce45e585f82e441d3b551e856b4d", "ja": "軽く言ってくれるよな……ったく。\nそれで、撮れたのか？　風景とか、ウチらの顔とか。", "zh": "说得倒轻巧……真是的。那，拍到了吗？风景什么的，还有咱们的脸什么的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_05_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "1dfcea76663dd24d3fa2a30b745a99466d37e82fc0149081cbbe62f63e91381e", "ja": "アクセル全開～、胃袋は限界～♪\n華麗なドリフト～、意識はフェードアウト～♪　うぅ。", "zh": "油门全开～，胃袋到极限～♪\n华丽漂移～，意识逐渐淡出～♪呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_05_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "d61f7e1933d63feca31b1a5b47cdf978bb9f5e81cc6bcdd07cac009c144d1b4a", "ja": "うぅ……わ、私たち、むしろ、\n映像に残しちゃいけない顔、してたような……うっ。", "zh": "呜呜……我、我们刚才的表情，不如说\n根本就不能留在录像里吧……唔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_05_1006_052kao", "source_sha256": "9aae7f2c453f1ef5c79b77e6f9fd55585065876ecb0dee0e9e8761c0a6e16cfb", "ja": "みんな、ごめんなさいね。\nハンドルを握るとつい、楽しくなってしまって……。", "zh": "大家，真是对不起啊。\n一握住方向盘，就不由得兴奋起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_05_1007_045kar", "source_sha256": "14a81d16947742d5a3f629034fe45ed4fcce531d4664073fa8abd51a08630e0e", "ja": "き、気を取り直して……{$P$}さん、\nインタビュー、しちゃいましょう……？", "zh": "那、那就重新振作一下……{$P$}先生，开始采访吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_05_1008_jimaku", "source_sha256": "0b74203627cdc8495c233f711cf6645f7b19e7cd8b5972cddee4482526181409", "ja": "アイドルとしての、『あなたの輝き』とは？", "zh": "作为偶像，『你的光芒』是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_05_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "d40c7dfc12ce1a34e50fccc57638c01a48eedc3c4378df8c9c4c0b5b8378e97c", "ja": "私はもちろん、歌です！\nららら～♪　可奈ソング～、シャイニング～♪", "zh": "当然是歌了！啦啦啦～♪ 可奈之歌～闪耀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_05_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "d75b0063e9b5bdfd4992cef0dee545fa434ae6be6926e8ecdf593ca15ac0e147", "ja": "劇場で歌えて、私、毎日がとっても楽しいです。\nもっと歌って、もっと上手になるぞ～！　おーっ♪", "zh": "能在剧场唱歌，我每天都特别开心。\n我要多唱歌，变得更擅长唱歌～！哦——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_05_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "583ed26dd64a359cc6a11bcabb21fefc25df37056fce75ed53ade01444dd7184", "ja": "そういう、底抜けにポジティブなのって、\n可奈のいいとこだよな。", "zh": "那种乐观得没边的劲头，就是可奈的优点啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_05_1012_052kao", "source_sha256": "f486f354d7ff92092e8e1ebfea28e4e6c2cfbf80e8c02a4a5781048a5927d5d0", "ja": "私は……私も可奈ちゃんと同じ、歌ね。新しい世界に\n触れた喜びや、胸の高鳴りを、表現したいの。", "zh": "我……我也和可奈一样，是歌呢。我想用歌声表达接触到新世界时的喜悦，以及心中的悸动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_05_1013_052kao", "source_sha256": "775a82b10f79607b59c5cf09358a11ad63e97825f0a3d5a2ac14f5c35f7a29fa", "ja": "それがきっと、私自身の輝きになる。\nそんなふうに思っています。ふふっ♪", "zh": "那一定会成为属于我自己的光芒。\n我是这样想的。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_05_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "bfc6e85f1770a07ef1c2c3f5eea918e50431bcc18b263658409ce80cff9ddd49", "ja": "あたしもだ。歌って言うより、音楽全部……かな。\n本当に好きなんだ、音を奏でるのがさ。", "zh": "我也是。与其说是唱歌，不如说是所有音乐……吧。\n我真的很喜欢演奏音乐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_05_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "13f8ac3c7fea88554d06090a43091e8c47185b9d31453ac3b4bd87372a6658f5", "ja": "歌でも、ギターでも……込み上げてきたものを、\n誰かと共有する……いつだって、最高の気分だよ。", "zh": "无论是唱歌，还是弹吉他……把心中涌起的感情与别人分享……无论何时，感觉都棒极了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_05_1016_045kar", "source_sha256": "b50e117ee6efdcc3e9b4b147e47c5e52c11230c86ccc5b2e6dbc417f08d084e5", "ja": "わ、私は……みんなみたいに、自信が持てるような、\n輝きなんて、な、何もなくて……ないけど……でも。", "zh": "我、我……没有像大家那样，能够让自己充满自信的光芒……什、什么都没有……虽然没有……可是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_05_1017_null", "source_sha256": "80a340802d62de8f6ad2b0f7833d210732c0bbd68f40cd03c1e448dd33a9a81f", "ja": "……でも？", "zh": "……不过？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_05_1018_045kar", "source_sha256": "02f24677660887bda71a1b1b10af9dc53139abe9445bca7988cef6269b0b134a", "ja": "さ、最近は……その、怖くても……\n私なんかって思うことが、少なくなった気がして……。", "zh": "最、最近……那个，就算害怕……\n也感觉自己不再那么常觉得“像我这样的人……”了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_05_1019_045kar", "source_sha256": "187615620d4c01e3e80d1efe6cc5228f1c2331a6ce715713d7c66eacf8509a78", "ja": "ほ、ほんの少しずつだけど、近づけてるのかなって\n思うこともあります。なりたい自分に……てへへ♪", "zh": "虽、虽然只是一点一点地……我有时也会想，自己是不是正在逐渐接近理想中的自己……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
